# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the re-record of the packed-any evidence on the K64j-OQ binary (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/oneq-ship and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. ONE TAG AT A TIME; wait for the run to finish; never cancel a running card job.
# Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host, a path or a registry, and every value is final: the cards are resolved at run time, the graft is the directory NAME opgraft-K64j-OQ under the
# runner's home (KOPGRAFT64_NAME, optimisation/ttnn-op/k64j/run_card_b.sh), its binary is pinned by the literal digest EXPECT_TTNNCPP_SHA256 (packed_any_admission.K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256,
# the K64J_OQ_TTNNCPP_SHA256 line of OQ-L1), and the served image is found on the host by its C2 tag (IMAGE_C2_TAG=tp4-oneq-1, the image OQ-B0 built; C2_IMAGE_TAG is the same tag).
# An EVIDENCE job: one harness on card M alone (C2_CARDS=pair: cardm is a pair-shaped step; only RQ0 resets the four boards). The K64j-OQ binary is mounted over the image's: read the
# launched argv, a graft mounted is not a graft executed. The harness is the K64j one (optimisation/ttnn-op/k64j): K64j-OQ carries K64j's four decode kernels and
# the chain reader byte for byte (the K64j-OQ build proves it), so the same sections, seeds and extents re-run on the new binary. A watcher job (W) runs before its full job and is not
# evidence; a REDUCED-PASS or a reduced scope is never evidence. After the last job of a window: scripts/ci/record_packed_any_evidence_tp4.py --binary k64j-oq (README of
# optimisation/ttnn-op/sdpa_prefill_oneq, 'Landing the K64j-OQ records').
# RQ1-F1 (STOP): CB1 at one KV head, full scope: seeds 0-4, the six K1 extents, the G4B3 and G8B2 combos at 0x21 and 0x23 (the harness defaults for --kv-heads 1), sections N, X,
# M, K, L, T. PASS: 'K64J_CARD verdict=PASS ... kv_heads=1', every decisive comparison byte-equal, every liveness control moved. Duration (estimate): 6 minutes.
C2_CARDS=pair
C2_ACTIONS=cardm
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-oneq-1
C2_CARDM_HARNESS=optimisation/ttnn-op/k64j/run_card_b.sh
C2_CARDM_ARGS=--kv-heads 1 --seeds 0,1,2,3,4
C2_CARDM_ENV=K64J_HARNESS=card IMAGE_C2_TAG=tp4-oneq-1 KOPGRAFT64_NAME=opgraft-K64j-OQ EXPECT_TTNNCPP_SHA256=2b81e28f017ccf0ab50028fbae5eb31dd61cfd8a3159233a1ed785712d024a57
